  "problemStatement": "Solve the initial value problem dy/dx = 4x (2x^2 + 1)^3 with initial condition y(0) = 2.",
  "finalAnswer": "y(x) = \\frac{(2x^2 + 1)^4}{4} + \\frac{7}{4}",
  "steps": [
